 "transcript": [
  "[action] goes to see father",
  "the eldest son (to Wang Lung): \"We have been working for two years and now we have a house and a wife and I can do as I like and my wife is a lady of a house and we are rich and we have many servants, and the sons of rich men are the greatest in the town and now my sons and I eat and drink in our house like rich men and we have many servants and we do as we like.\"",
  "[action] (to the eldest son) Wang Lung listens and is astonished.",
  "[silence] the eldest son says nothing.",
  "[action] Wang Lung is puzzled by his son's pride.",
  "[says] (to the eldest son) Wang Lung expresses his surprise at his son's wealth.",
  "Wang Lung (to the eldest son): \"Well, and why have you not said this before and now I know why you have not come to me for money, for you have gold and you are rich and you are a man!\"",
  "[action] The second son enters the room suddenly.",
  "the second son (to Wang Lung): \"And I will have money and land like that---money and land---money and land!\"",
  "[action] (to Wang Lung) The eldest son looks at his brother.",
  "Wang Lung (to the eldest son, the second son): \"What!\"",
  "the eldest son (to Wang Lung): \"Well, and my wife and I are rich and we have a house and we have a wife and we eat and drink and we have servants and we live like rich men and we do as we like and we are rich men and we are rich men!\"",
  "Wang Lung (to the eldest son): \"Well, and am I not your father?\"",
  "[action] (to the eldest son, the second son) Wang Lung stands between his sons and shouts.",
  "[action] (to the second son) The eldest son looks at his father and laughs.",
  "Wang Lung (to the eldest son, the second son): \"Well, and am I not your father?\"",
  "[action] (to Wang Lung) The second son shrugs, laughs, and looks at his brother.",
  "the second son (to the eldest son): \"And what can you do with money except give it to a woman to sit idle and to spend and to eat and to wear?\"",
  "the second son (to the eldest son): \"Well, and it is only a woman if you do not give it to another man---\"",
  "[action] (to Wang Lung) The second son laughs at his father."
 ],
